# Recruiter Site — environment variables
# Copy to recruiter-site/.env if you need to override defaults. Never commit real .env files.

# API base URL
# Local dev default: "/api" — Vite dev server proxies /api to the API on :3000
# (see vite.config.ts). No .env file is required for local development.
VITE_API_URL="/api"

# Production (Vercel API deployment — active project portafolio-v2-api,
# production domain portafolio-v2-api-v2.vercel.app; the legacy domain
# portafolio-v2-api.vercel.app belongs to the archived project and is stale).
# NOTE: the base URL must end with /api because api modules use paths like
# /portfolio/projects relative to the API root.
# VITE_API_URL="https://portafolio-v2-api-v2.vercel.app/api"